  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.3 - Dependency update: SpawnDev.SpawnJS.WebWorkers 2.2.1 -> 2.2.4. An extension that references only this package now gets main.classic.js / main.module.js through WebWorkers buildTransitive targets (before 2.2.4 an indirect consumer silently got no bundle, so the background service worker importScripts(main.classic.js) 404ed), and a Blazor-SDK extension no longer needs SpawnJSWebWorkersBlazor=false. Includes WebWorkers 2.2.2 ServiceWorker fixes: a .NET ServiceWorker starts offline from Cache Storage, and held events are released if .NET fails to start. Fixed: StorageChange<T>.OldValue() / NewValue() use the class T (they declared their own T, which shadowed it, so callers had to write OldValue<T>(); source-breaking only for that form). Doc and nullability fixes.",
